    "category": "Projectile Weapons",
    "kind": "weapon",
    "value": 8,
    "rarity": "Rare",
    "keywords": [
      "AELDARI",
      "HARLEQUIN"
    ],
    "effect": "Range 9/18/27, Salvo 1, Blast (6), Inflict (Fear 4). The Hallucinogen and Phantasm Grenade Launchers are designed to deliver very specific payloads. Though uncommon, they can also fire other types of grenades with modification. Changing the payload requires a successful DN 4 Tech Use (Int) Test and an hour of uninterrupted work.",
    "note": "Damage, ED and AP printed \"–\", so there is no weapon entry: range, salvo and traits are in effect. \"Inflict (Fear 4)\" as printed (Fear is not a Core Condition). The payload rule is from the section introduction."
  },
